WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.880
illness and genuine distress can create exemptions

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:06.060
from sukkah dwelling.

00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:09.140
Adapt preparation to real circumstances.

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:12.520
Habit design must respect the law, not

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:13.560
invent an exemption.
